{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.binding_density_within_tolerance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.binding_density_within_tolerance","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L94-L105","doc":"**Downstream conditional theorem.**  Conditional on\n`[Term6BindingDensity]`, every nucleus has its per-nucleon\nbinding within `tolerance` of the structural formula.  Fully\nverified by Lean once an instance is fixed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.binding_density_shape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.binding_density_shape","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L88-L88","doc":"**Structural-shape claim (the conjectural piece):** for\nevery nucleus, the AME binding-per-nucleon is approximated by\nthe calibrated structural formula within `tolerance`.  A\nconcrete instance discharges this with `sorry` (the\ncalibration; ~3% uncertainty per the 16-atom fit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.tolerance_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.tolerance_pos","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Tolerance is positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.tolerance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.tolerance","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L80-L80","doc":"Calibration window — the structural shape matches AME within\n`tolerance` (~3% of `alpha · T_6 / A^3` plus residual ~1 MeV). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.B_AME","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.B_AME","kind":"def","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L77-L77","doc":"AME binding energy datum (input). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.delta_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.delta_M","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Magic-shell operator correction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.beta","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.beta","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Calibration intercept. Empirically ~1.14 MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.alpha","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.alpha","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L71-L71","doc":"Calibration coefficient (Term-6 prefactor). Empirically ~339 MeV. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.T_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.T_6","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L69-L69","doc":"Term-6 spectral-sequence stratum value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.Term6BindingDensity","kind":"class","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L51-L92","doc":"**Term 6 binding-density class.**  An instance asserts:\n\n1. `T_6 : NucleusDatum → ℝ` — the level-3 stratum contribution.\n2. `alpha, beta : ℝ` — calibration coefficients (CALIBRATED,\n   not yet categorically derived).\n3. `delta_M : NucleusDatum → ℝ` — magic-shell operator\n   correction.\n4. `binding_density_shape` — for every nucleus the\n   per-nucleon binding equals\n   `alpha · T_6 / A^3 + beta + delta_M`.\n\nThe shape is structurally derived from\n`prop:gb-spectral-sequence`. The values of `alpha` and `beta`\nare empirically calibrated; a `sorry` in any concrete instance\nof `binding_density_shape` represents the calibration\nuncertainty (~3%) and the open derivation question. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.MAGIC_LADDER","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.MAGIC_LADDER","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L48-L49","doc":"The seven nuclear magic numbers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.A","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L45-L46","doc":"Mass number A = Z + N. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.N","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.Z","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.NucleusDatum","kind":"structure","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/Term6BindingDensity.lean#L40-L43","doc":"Atomic-nucleus datum: proton count Z, neutron count N. ","signatureChunk":0}]}